exports[`Project detail page > keeps the markup of avlulu-konut 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" imageSizes="100vw"/><section class="pt-[var(--hdr)]"><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-beton md:aspect-[16/9] xl:aspect-auto xl:h-[min(88svh,calc(100vw*9/21))] xl:min-h-[520px]"><img alt="Avlulu konut konsepti: avlu ve zeytin ağacı panoraması" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:56% 58%;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-wide.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="wrap relative"><div class="on-dark bg-pose p-6 text-kirec md:p-10 xl:-mt-[18vh] xl:w-[min(46vw,720px)] xl:p-12"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><span class="badge">Konsept Çalışma</span><span class="label muted">Mimari</span></div><h1 class="d-l mt-6">Avlulu Konut</h1></div><p class="caption mt-3 xl:text-right">İllüstratif görsel</p></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kagit !pb-[clamp(72px,8vw,128px)]"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><dl class="col-span-4 grid content-start gap-6 md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-4"><div><dt class="label muted">Tür</dt><dd class="mt-2">Konut · Mimari</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Kapsam</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#mimari-tasarim">Mimari Proje</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#gorsellestirme">3D Modelleme</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#mimari-tasarim">Paket Proje</a></dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Durum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Konsept / İllüstratif</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Konum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Temsilî</dd></div></dl><div class="prose col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><p class="lead !max-w-[34ch]">Alçak, kompakt bir konut. Avlu, evin kütlesine açılmış bir oda gibi çalışıyor.</p><div class="mt-8"><p>Kireç sıvalı kütleler, derin içe çekilmiş açıklıklar ve tek bir avlu. Konsept, yapının neyi kapattığı kadar neyi açık bıraktığına bakıyor.</p><p>Beton, meşe ve ince çelik; az malzeme, net oran. Her açıklık gün ışığının gün içindeki yolunu hesaba katarak konumlanıyor.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-kagit pb-[clamp(96px,12vw,200px)]" aria-label="Mekân dizisi"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-[clamp(56px,9vw,144px)] md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><figure class="col-span-4 md:col-span-5 xl:col-start-1 xl:col-span-7 "><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in overflow-hidden bg-beton" style="aspect-ratio:3 / 2" data-slot="landscape" aria-label="Görseli büyüt: Avlulu konut konsepti: giriş açıklığı ve avludaki zeytin ağacı"><img alt="Avlulu konut konsepti: giriş açıklığı ve avludaki zeytin ağacı" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:52% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 56vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Giriş</figcaption></figure><figure class="col-span-4 max-md:mr-[12%] md:col-start-6 md:col-span-3 xl:col-start-8 xl:col-span-5 xl:mt-[12vh]"><div data-from="right" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in overflow-hidden bg-beton" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 5" data-slot="portrait" aria-label="Görseli büyüt: Avlulu konut konsepti: kapalı galeride ışık ve gölge"><img alt="Avlulu konut konsepti: kapalı galeride ışık ve gölge" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 38vw, 88vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-portrait.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Galeri</figcaption></figure><p class="col-span-4 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-2 xl:col-span-5 xl:col-start-3 lead muted">Avlu, evin kütlesine açılmış bir oda: ışık önce oraya giriyor.</p><figure class="col-span-4 md:col-span-6 md:col-start-2 xl:col-start-2 xl:col-span-5 "><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in overflow-hidden bg-beton" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1" data-slot="square" aria-label="Görseli büyüt: Avlulu konut konsepti: malzeme detayı"><img alt="Avlulu konut konsepti: malzeme detayı" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 38vw, 88vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-square.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Malzeme detayı</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kirec" aria-labelledby="not-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-4"><h2 id="not-h" class="d-l">Konsept <span class="w8">kararları.</span></h2><p class="label muted mt-8">Malzeme paleti</p><ul class="mt-4 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Kireç sıva</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Brüt beton</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Meşe</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Siyah çelik</li></ul><p class="caption mt-8 max-w-[34ch]">Konsept çalışma; ölçü, yıl, konum ve müşteri bilgisi içermez.</p></div><ol class="col-span-4 list-none border-t border-pose md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">01</span><h3 class="d-m">Avlu bir oda</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Açık hava, evin içindeki en büyük oda gibi planlandı; tüm mekânlar ona bakıyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">02</span><h3 class="d-m">Derin açıklıklar</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Pencereler duvar kalınlığının içine çekildi; yaz güneşi süzülüyor, kış ışığı içeri giriyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">03</span><h3 class="d-m">Az malzeme</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Dört malzeme, net oranlar. Detay sayısı azaldıkça, kalan detay daha dikkatli çizilir.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="on-dark"><a class="card group block bg-pose text-kirec" href="/projeler/daire-yenileme"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-8 py-[clamp(64px,8vw,128px)] md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-5 xl:col-span-6"><p class="label muted">Sonraki proje</p><p class="d-l mt-5">Daire Yenileme</p><p class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 font-medium">Projeyi incele <span class="card-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></p></div><div class="zoom relative col-span-4 aspect-[3/2] overflow-hidden bg-beton md:col-span-3 md:col-start-6 xl:col-span-5 xl:col-start-8"><img alt="Daire yenileme konsepti: salon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 40vw, (min-width:768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div></a><div class="wrap bg-pose py-6 text-kirec"><a class="tlink" href="/projeler">← Tüm projeler</a></div></section><footer class="sec-k on-dark mass-in-l" style="padding-top:clamp(64px,7vw,112px)"><div class="wrap"><div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-10 border-t border-golge pt-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-4"><span role="img" aria-label="Gül CAN Mimarlık" class="logo" style="width:320px;max-width:100%"></span></div><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-2 xl:col-span-3 xl:col-start-6"><p class="label muted">Adres</p><address class="mt-3 not-italic"><span class="block">Cumhuriyet Mahallesi</span><span class="block">Şehit Mustafa Sarı Sokak No:114</span></address></div><nav aria-label="Alt menü" class="col-span-4 md:col-span-2 xl:col-span-3 xl:col-start-10"><p class="label muted">Sayfalar</p><ul class="mt-3 flex flex-col"><li><a class="big-link inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center" href="/projeler">Projeler</a></li><li><a class="big-link inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center" href="/hizmetler">Hizmetler</a></li><li><a class="big-link inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center" href="/studyo">Stüdyo</a></li><li><a class="big-link inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center" href="/iletisim">İletişim</a></li></ul></nav></div><div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-golge pt-6 text-[14px] text-siva md:flex-row md:justify-between"><p>© 2026 Gül CAN Mimarlık</p><p>Bu site bir tasarım demosudur. Portföy içerikleri illüstratiftir.</p></div></div></footer>"`;

exports[`Project detail page > keeps the markup of daire-yenileme 1`] = `"<link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" imageSizes="100vw"/><section class="pt-[var(--hdr)]"><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-beton md:aspect-[16/9] xl:aspect-auto xl:h-[min(88svh,calc(100vw*9/21))] xl:min-h-[520px]"><img alt="Daire yenileme konsepti: salon" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="wrap relative"><div class="on-dark bg-pose p-6 text-kirec md:p-10 xl:-mt-[18vh] xl:w-[min(46vw,720px)] xl:p-12"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><span class="badge">Konsept Çalışma</span><span class="label muted">İç Mimarlık</span></div><h1 class="d-l mt-6">Daire Yenileme</h1></div><p class="caption mt-3 xl:text-right">İllüstratif görsel</p></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kagit !pb-[clamp(72px,8vw,128px)]"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><dl class="col-span-4 grid content-start gap-6 md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-4"><div><dt class="label muted">Tür</dt><dd class="mt-2">Konut içi · İç Mimarlık</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Kapsam</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#ic-mimarlik">İç Mimarlık Hizmetleri</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#uygulama">Uygulama</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#uygulama">Anahtar Teslim</a></dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Durum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Konsept / İllüstratif</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Konum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Temsilî</dd></div></dl><div class="prose col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><p class="lead !max-w-[34ch]">Eski bir apartman salonu, aynı geometriyle yeniden kuruldu: yüzeyler sadeleşti, ışık kaldı.</p><div class="mt-8"><p>Pencere, kiriş ve kolon yerinde kalıyor. Değişen yalnızca yüzeyler ve mobilya: sıva, mikro beton, meşe ve keten.</p><p>Önce / sonra karşılaştırması konsept amaçlı illüstratif görsellerle hazırlanmıştır.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-kagit pb-[clamp(96px,12vw,200px)]" aria-label="Mekân dizisi"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-[clamp(56px,9vw,144px)] md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><figure class="col-span-4 md:col-span-5 xl:col-start-1 xl:col-span-5 "><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in o