, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Yenilenmiş salon</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kirec" aria-labelledby="not-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-4"><h2 id="not-h" class="d-l">Konsept <span class="w8">kararları.</span></h2><p class="label muted mt-8">Malzeme paleti</p><ul class="mt-4 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Kireç sıva</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Mikro beton</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Meşe</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Keten</li></ul><p class="caption mt-8 max-w-[34ch]">Konsept çalışma; ölçü, yıl, konum ve müşteri bilgisi içermez.</p></div><ol class="col-span-4 list-none border-t border-pose md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">01</span><h3 class="d-m">Geometri sabit</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Pencere, kiriş ve kolon yerinde; yenileme mekânın bildiği şeyi bozmadan başlıyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">02</span><h3 class="d-m">Yüzeyler sadeleşti</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Çok katmanlı kaplamalar yerine tek renkli sıva ve sürekli zemin; oda daha büyük okunuyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">03</span><h3 class="d-m">Işık kaldı</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Perde ve mobilya, gün ışığının odada ilerleyişini kesmeyecek biçimde yerleştirildi.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kagit" aria-labelledby="ba-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-4 xl:pt-4"><h2 id="ba-h" class="d-l">Önce <span class="w3">/</span> <span class="w8">Sonra</span></h2><p class="lead mt-6 max-w-[26ch]">Pencere, kiriş ve kolon aynı kalıyor; yüzeyler değişiyor.</p></div><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-8"><div class="ba" data-mode="slider"><div class="ba-stage" data-smooth="0" style="--pos:50%;--op:0"><img alt="Yenileme sonrası konsept salon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 60vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-after.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/><div class="ba-top"><img alt="Yenileme öncesi konsept salon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 60vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp2-be