 gap-3"><span class="badge">Konsept Çalışma</span><span class="label muted">İç Mimarlık</span></div><h1 class="d-l mt-6">Köşe Kafe</h1></div><p class="caption mt-3 xl:text-right">İllüstratif görsel</p></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kagit !pb-[clamp(72px,8vw,128px)]"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><dl class="col-span-4 grid content-start gap-6 md:col-span-4 xl:col-span-4"><div><dt class="label muted">Tür</dt><dd class="mt-2">Ticari · İç Mimarlık</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Kapsam</dt><dd class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#ic-mimarlik">Tasarım</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#uygulama">Uygulama</a><a class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium hover:bg-pose hover:text-kirec" href="/hizmetler#uygulama">Şantiye Şefliği</a></dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Durum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Konsept / İllüstratif</dd></div><div><dt class="label muted">Konum</dt><dd class="mt-2">Temsilî</dd></div></dl><div class="prose col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><p class="lead !max-w-[34ch]">Köşe bir dükkân: iki cephe cam, tek uzun bank, mikro beton zemin.</p><div class="mt-8"><p>Ticari mekân konsepti. Işık iki yönden giriyor, malzeme paleti dar tutuluyor: meşe, sıva, siyah çelik, keten.</p><p>Konsept çalışma; gerçek bir müşteri veya mekân değildir.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-kagit pb-[clamp(96px,12vw,200px)]" aria-label="Mekân dizisi"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-[clamp(56px,9vw,144px)] md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><figure class="col-span-4 md:col-span-5 xl:col-start-1 xl:col-span-5 "><div data-from="left" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in overflow-hidden bg-beton" style="aspect-ratio:4 / 5" data-slot="portrait" aria-label="Görseli büyüt: Köşe kafe konsepti: bank ve tezgâh"><img alt="Köşe kafe konsepti: bank ve tezgâh" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 38vw, 88vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-cover.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Bank</figcaption></figure><figure class="col-span-4 max-md:mr-[12%] md:col-start-6 md:col-span-3 xl:col-start-8 xl:col-span-5 xl:mt-[12vh]"><div data-from="right" class="wipe"><button type="button" class="card zoom relative block w-full cursor-zoom-in overflow-hidden bg-beton" style="aspect-ratio:1 / 1" data-slot="square" aria-label="Görseli büyüt: Köşe kafe konsepti: tezgâh detayı"><img alt="Köşe kafe konsepti: tezgâh detayı" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 38vw, 88vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp4-square.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></button></div><figcaption class="caption mt-3">İllüstratif görsel · Tezgâh detayı</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class="sec-b bg-kirec" aria-labelledby="not-h"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 gap-x-4 gap-y-12 md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-4"><h2 id="not-h" class="d-l">Konsept <span class="w8">kararları.</span></h2><p class="label muted mt-8">Malzeme paleti</p><ul class="mt-4 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2"><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Meşe</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Kireç sıva</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Siyah çelik</li><li class="border border-pose px-3 py-2 text-[14px] font-medium">Keten</li></ul><p class="caption mt-8 max-w-[34ch]">Konsept çalışma; ölçü, yıl, konum ve müşteri bilgisi içermez.</p></div><ol class="col-span-4 list-none border-t border-pose md:col-span-8 xl:col-span-7 xl:col-start-6"><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">01</span><h3 class="d-m">İki yönden ışık</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Köşe konumu avantaja çevrildi: sabah ve öğleden sonra ışığı farklı masalara düşüyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">02</span><h3 class="d-m">Tek uzun bank</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Oturma düzeni, mekânı tek çizgide toplayıp servis akışını sadeleştiriyor.</p></li><li class="grid gap-2 border-b border-pose/30 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] md:gap-6 md:py-9"><span class="label muted pt-2">03</span><h3 class="d-m">Dar malzeme paleti</h3><p class="muted max-w-[40ch]">Dört malzeme; bakımı kolay, zamanla yaşlanabilen yüzeyler.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="on-dark"><a class="card group block bg-pose text-kirec" href="/projeler/avlulu-konut"><div class="wrap grid grid-cols-4 items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-8 py-[clamp(64px,8vw,128px)] md:grid-cols-8 md:gap-x-5 xl:grid-cols-12 xl:gap-x-6"><div class="col-span-4 md:col-span-5 xl:col-span-6"><p class="label muted">Sonraki proje</p><p class="d-l mt-5">Avlulu Konut</p><p class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3 font-medium">Projeyi incele <span class="card-arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span></p></div><div class="zoom relative col-span-4 aspect-[3/2] overflow-hidden bg-beton md:col-span-3 md:col-start-6 xl:col-span-5 xl:col-start-8"><img alt="Avlulu konut konsepti: giriş açıklığı ve avludaki zeytin ağacı" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:52% 55%;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width:1280px) 40vw, (min-width:768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fp1-cover.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w